Package: stim_artifact_removal
Type: rave-pipeline
Title: Remove Electrical Stimulation Artifacts From Raw 'iEEG' Voltage
Version: 0.0.1
Language: en-US
Encoding: UTF-8
License: MIT
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhengjia", "Wang", email = "zhengjia.wang@pennmedicine.upenn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description:
    Removes electrical stimulation artifacts from raw intracranial voltage
    traces using per-pulse template subtraction, principal-component
    inspection of residual artifact bases, and moving-average gap-filling of
    the blanked stimulation window. Produces cleaned per-block voltage traces
    that can be exported back to the 'RAVE' subject for downstream processing.
BugReports: https://github.com/orgs/rave-ieeg/discussions
URL: https://rave.wiki, https://github.com/rave-ieeg/rave-pipelines
